OL,3,AFirm offers to fake artworks for
OL,4,Awealthy migrants seeking UK 'talent'
OL,5,Avisas - BBC investigation
OL,6,
OL,7,FCompanies are offering to help migrants
OL,8,Fpose as talented artists and tech
OL,9,Fexperts to make fraudulent UK visa
OL,10,Fapplications under a fast-track
OL,11,Fimmigration scheme, the BBC has found.
OL,13,FThe UK government's Global Talent visa
OL,14,Fwas launched in 2020 to attract the
OL,15,F"brightest and best" scientists and
OL,16,Fresearchers from around the world. It
OL,17,Fis also open to creative artists.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,180,160,200,105,0,100
