OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFirm offers to fake artworks for
OL,4,Awealthy migrants seeking UK 'talent'
OL,5,Avisas - BBC investigation
OL,6,
OL,7,FFollowing our investigation, the Home
OL,8,FOffice is now revoking visas issued to
OL,9,Ftwo Nigerian men who claimed to be fine
OL,10,Fart photographers, because it believes
OL,11,Fthey were obtained by deception.
OL,13,FApplicants for Global Talent visas are
OL,14,Fnot interviewed. People granted them
OL,15,Fneed to prove they are exceptionally
OL,16,Ftalented or promising in their field.
OL,17,FThey can then bring their families to
OL,18,Fthe UK and there is a potentially quick
OL,19,Fpath to permanent residency - in three
OL,20,For five years.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
